 {
  "id": "wledcompo_tab",
  "type": "tab",
  "label": "WLED Composition",
  "disabled": false,
  "info": "Composition d'un panneau WLED depuis Node-RED, en HTTP.\nRealise par domo-lab31 - Kenny3231\n\nTout passe par POST /api/panel/<id> sur le hub. Le noeud\n« adresse du hub » est le SEUL endroit ou changer l'IP.\n\nChamps utiles :\n  compose_text, text2   texte des zones libres\n  icons                 [1431, 510] ou \"1431,510\", 3 maxi\n  icon_side             left | center | right (1 icone)\n  bg_mode               none | solid | gradient | rainbow\n  bg, bg_to             [r,g,b]\n  bg_axis, bg_anim      h|v, 0 a 2\n  text_mode             solid | gradient | rainbow\n  text_color, text_to   [r,g,b]\n  text_anim, speed\n\nDeux icones se centrent, trois se repartissent : icon_side\nne sert que lorsqu'il y en a une seule. Les icones LaMetric\nfont 8x8, donc uniquement sur une dalle de hauteur 8."
 },
 {
  "id": "i_c1",
  "type": "inject",
  "z": "wledcompo_tab",
  "name": "Composition complete",
  "props": [
   {
    "p": "payload"
   }
  ],
  "repeat": "",
  "crontab": "",
  "once": false,
  "topic": "",
  "payload": "",
  "payloadType": "date",
  "x": 160,
  "y": 80,
  "wires": [
   [
    "f_c1"
   ]
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "f_c1",
  "type": "function",
  "z": "wledcompo_tab",
  "name": "Composition complete",
  "func": "// Fond degrade qui glisse, texte en degrade, une icone a gauche.\nmsg.chemin = '/api/panel/anim_panel_bureau';\nmsg.payload = {\n    animation: 'compose',\n    icons: [1431],\n    icon_side: 'left',\n    compose_text: 'SALUT',\n    bg_mode: 'gradient', bg: [0, 40, 90], bg_to: [90, 0, 60],\n    bg_axis: 'h', bg_anim: 0.2,\n    text_mode: 'gradient', text_color: [255, 255, 255], text_to: [255, 200, 0]\n};\nreturn msg;",
  "outputs": 1,
  "timeout": 0,
  "noerr": 0,
  "initialize": "",
  "finalize": "",
  "libs": [],
  "x": 430,
  "y": 80,
  "wires": [
   [
    "adresse"
   ]
  ]
 },
